                                                "sense_id": "7c7b7111-b8fc-3b0e-9305-a568bea2aef7",
                                                "text": "Another 60 karatekas will go head to head in kumite, three-minute sparring bouts in which athletes attempt to land a series of precise blows on their opponent’s body."
                                            }
                                        ]
